===Etymology 2===
From northern {{inh|de|gmh|wer}}, {{m|gmh|were}}, borrowed from {{der|de|gml|wēr}}, {{m|gml|wēre}}, from {{der|de|osx|wer}}. Derived from {{der|de|gem-pro|*warjaną}} as in etymology 1, and sometimes thought to have been originally the same word. Compare {{cog|en|weir}}.<ref>http://www.dwds.de/?qu=Wehr&hidx=2</ref>

